[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Prison Break</h2>
<i>Voice In You Head: ~wYo, what's up?<br>
<i>You: ~wUmmm...You the hell are you?<br>
<i>Voice In You Head: ~wA DL specialist.  I use telepathy to speak.<br>
<i>You: ~wObvisouly... what do you want?<br>
<i>DL Specialist: ~wLately, I have been guilding you here, to the DL.  I want you to rescue us.  There is also some of your friends here.<br>
<i>You: ~wOk...where are you?<br>
<i>DL Specialist: ~wIn section 8796, we are ina  prison cell.<br>
<i>You: ~wCan't you break out?<br>
<i>DL Specialist: ~wMost definitely, put we would be hunted down.  I'll give you a mental map...<br>
<<<Strange vibrations enter your head...You get a mental picture of the section.>>>
<i>You: ~wI see, here's the plan, you break to the neutral island, and I will keep them busy until I completely free you.

$Button=What ya got,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Travel to the Section,DoNothing,0

